# Widget Preview related
.widget_preview/

# === Firebase / secrets ===
# Defense in depth — each platform also has its own .gitignore.
# These patterns would otherwise let a service-account JSON slip through
# if it's placed at the repo root or in a less-expected location.
**/service-account*.json
**/serviceAccount*.json
**/firebase-adminsdk-*.json
**/secrets.h
**/secrets.json

# Web: `web/.env.local` is gitignored by Next.js' default .gitignore.
# (`.env*.local` is excluded; `.env.local.example` is allowed through.)
